### Historical oru2fhir demo — ready-to-run requests (VS Code REST Client;
### IntelliJ's HTTP client also supports this format).
### OIE's HTTPS API uses a self-signed certificate: in VS Code, set
### "http.proxyStrictSSL": false (or accept the certificate) for @oie requests.

@oru = http://localhost:10801/oru/
@patient = http://localhost:10802/patient/
@strictPatient = http://localhost:10808/patient/
@fmlTypedBundle = http://localhost:10807/bundle/
@fmlInlinePatient = http://localhost:10809/patient/
@labo = http://localhost:10803/labo/
@sqlPatient = http://localhost:10804/sql-patient/
@csvPatients = http://localhost:10805/csv-patients/
@csvCollection = http://localhost:10806/csv-patients-collection/
@organizationR5 = http://localhost:10810/organization-r5/
@frCorePatient = http://localhost:10811/patient-fr-core/
@fhirSummary = http://localhost:10812/patient-summary/
@oie = https://localhost:8443/api
@auth = Basic admin:admin
@channel = 5d0f6c2a-8b3e-4f1a-9c7d-2e6b1a0f3c48
@ig = /fhir-volume/ig
@base = http://example.org/fhir/oru2fhir

### Business JSON → Organization R5 (markdown description)
POST {{organizationR5}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/organisation-metier.json

### Expected error: Organization.active is not a boolean
POST {{organizationR5}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/organisation-metier-invalide.json

### Business JSON → FR Core 2.2.0 Patient, local identifier and birthplace
POST {{frCorePatient}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/patient-metier-fr-core.json

### Expected error: official is excluded for PI identifier use
POST {{frCorePatient}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/patient-metier-fr-core-invalide.json

### FHIR Patient → FML projection, preserving active:false and omitting telecom
POST {{fhirSummary}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/patient-fhir-source.json

### Expected error: unknown gender is not a permitted FHIR code
POST {{fhirSummary}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/patient-fhir-source-invalide.json

### 1. Complete example: the response is a transaction Bundle (12 entries)
# charset=UTF-8: without it, the HTTP listener reads ISO-8859-1 and corrupts accents.
POST {{oru}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-labo.er7

### 2. A single result, without encounter or specimen (4 entries)
POST {{oru}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-minimal.er7

### Structured diagnostic: boolean conversion fails, FHIR validation disabled
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/test
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./api/diagnostic-error.json

### An absent optional value requires an explicit guard in the expression
# msg.optional.gender throws TypeError; msg.optional && msg.optional.gender omits the element.
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/test
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./api/typeerror-error.json

### Preview trace: skipped condition, absent value, conversion and constant
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/test
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./api/trace-preview.json

### A SQL XML row from the patient business table to ExampleLabPatient
POST {{sqlPatient}}
Content-Type: application/xml; charset=UTF-8

< ./xml/patient-result-sql.xml

### CSV with 10 patients: source cleanup, FHIR mapping in the destination
# One message per row in the dashboard; the HTTP response contains the last Patient.
POST {{csvPatients}}
Content-Type: text/csv; charset=UTF-8

< ./csv/patients-metier-10.csv

### The same complete CSV to a collection of ten Patients (one OIE message)
POST {{csvCollection}}
Content-Type: text/csv; charset=UTF-8

< ./csv/patients-metier-10.csv

### Two laboratory Bundles: transaction response; document in bundleDocument and destination 2
POST {{labo}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-labo.er7

### 3. Missing birth date: rejected by the Patient profile, empty response (message in ERROR)
POST {{oru}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-sans-date-de-naissance.er7

### 4. Latest channel messages, with status and any error
GET {{oie}}/channels/{{channel}}/messages?limit=3&includeContent=true
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/xml

### 5. Plugin: profiles from the example IG
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/profiles?fhirVersion=R4&profiles={{ig}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 6. Plugin: a profile with its snapshot (shown as a tree in the editor)
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/structure?url={{base}}/StructureDefinition/ExampleLabObservation&fhirVersion=R4&profiles={{ig}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 7. Plugin: IG ConceptMaps (without a terminology server: n/a)
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/conceptMaps?server=n/a&profiles={{ig}}&fhirVersion=R4
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 8. Plugin: local ConceptMap/$translate, GLU to LOINC
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/translate?server=n/a&profiles={{ig}}&conceptMap={{base}}/ConceptMap/lab-codes-to-loinc&system={{base}}/CodeSystem/lab-codes&code=GLU&fhirVersion=R4
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 9. A single Patient conforming to ExampleLabPatient
POST {{patient}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-minimal.er7

### 9a. The same Patient, ORU read by the HL7 v2 Strict Parser (HAPI XML, typed groups and components)
POST {{strictPatient}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-minimal.er7
### 9b. Patient + Observation Bundle using typed FML maps ORUR01toBundle and PIDtoPatient
POST {{fmlTypedBundle}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-minimal.er7

### 9c. The same Patient using the step's inline map (mapSource), without a map file
POST {{fmlInlinePatient}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-minimal.er7

### 9d. The OIE logical model (OieMessage) received by the map for this message
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-fml/source
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Content-Type: text/plain

{"message": "MSH|^~\\&|LAB|EXAMPLE-LAB|OIE|EXAMPLE-HOSP|20260114171908||ORU^R01^ORU_R01|MSG-0002|P|2.5.1\rPID|1||100001^^^EXAMPLE^PI||MARTIN^CLAIRE^ANNE^^Mme^^L||19800215|F", "dataType": "HL7V2", "profiles": "/fhir-volume/ig;/fhir-volume/fml"}
